  <plot>A twelve-episode weather serial from Lumen Harbor. Each installment is one watch: first, middle, or last. The lamp is a recurring character. The moths have a union clause in the credits. Dialogue is mostly rain, static, and the sound of a fountain pen on wet paper. Café scenes exist only as steam on glass. One episode was filmed in 東京 and then the fog ate the call sheet.</plot>
